  m_Name: ThemeProfile_FutureResearchLab
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ThemeId: future_research_lab
  DisplayName: Future Research Lab
  ShortDescription: Cool, precise, research-focused lighting and accents for the
    canonical room.
  Category: 0
  AccentColor: {r: 0.22, g: 0.87, b: 0.96, a: 1}
  SurfaceMaterials:
    WallMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: f7a17f46515704455b0700686de8030e, type: 2}
    FloorMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 17e8d860006ed4f988a40c287d30d350, type: 2}
    CeilingMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 58ed60b07ecec4f7aa99b26c5454f354, type: 2}
    DoorFrameMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    WindowFrameMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PatternFamily: 0
    WallColor: {r: 0.18, g: 0.74, b: 0.92, a: 0.92}
    FloorColor: {r: 0.12, g: 0.42, b: 0.56, a: 0.82}
    CeilingColor: {r: 0.68, g: 0.9, b: 0.98, a: 0.65}
    DoorFrameColor: {r: 0.18, g: 0.88, b: 0.96, a: 0.86}
    WindowFrameColor: {r: 0.58, g: 0.92, b: 1, a: 0.74}
    WindowVistaColor: {r: 0.22, g: 0.74, b: 1, a: 0.78}
    SurfaceOpacity: 0.88
    EmissionIntensity: 0.32
    TextureTiling: 4.5
    PatternStrength: 0.82
    WallTexturePromptHint: Seamless cool-white and cyan laboratory wall panel material
      with broad room-scale composite panels, sparse luminous seams, and restrained
      research-room readability. Avoid tiny wallpaper-like repeats.
    FloorTexturePromptHint: Seamless dark graphite laboratory floor material with
      broad low-glare anti-slip panels, sparse cyan guide traces, and clear walkable-space
      readability. Avoid dense micro grids.
    CeilingTreatmentPromptHint: Soft overhead research-lab light panel treatment
      with broad pale cyan light fields, sparse modular ceiling panels, and no heavy
      geometry that hides the real ceiling.
    DoorFramePromptHint: Full cyan-lit laboratory door or portal panel with brushed
      composite surface, inset technical paneling, subtle edge glow, and flat doorway-aligned
      placement. It should read as a complete door, not only a frame.
    WindowFramePromptHint: Reusable translucent research-lab window trim with pale
      cyan edge glow, subtle data-line etching, and an open center so the real view
      remains visible. The silhouette can be rounded or sci-fi rather than strictly
      square.
    WindowVistaPromptHint: Wide exterior vista beyond a research-lab window, showing
      a distant cyan-lit night campus or clean futuristic skyline with atmospheric
      depth. No window frame, no room interior, no people, no readable text.
  Mood:
    MainLightColor: {r: 0.83, g: 0.95, b: 1, a: 1}
    MainLightIntensity: 1.18
    AmbientSkyColor: {r: 0.16, g: 0.26, b: 0.34, a: 1}
    AmbientEquatorColor: {r: 0.11, g: 0.16, b: 0.22, a: 1}
    AmbientGroundColor: {r: 0.05, g: 0.07, b: 0.1, a: 1}
  DefaultTableProxy: {fileID: 7609835186080491085, guid: 4d2a7023b7bad4dc1b89fb897ca08977, type: 3}
  DefaultSeatProxy: {fileID: 0}
  DefaultStorageProxy: {fileID: 0}
  DefaultScreenTreatmentPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  PreserveCollisionSensitiveFootprints: 1
  ReplacementRules:
  - SemanticLabel: wall
    FunctionTag: boundary
    Mode: 1
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 0
    ReplicaName: modular illuminated lab wall panels
    ReplicaFunction: boundary
    AppearancePrompt: Cool-white composite wall panels with cyan luminous seams,
      subtle embedded data traces, brushed ceramic-metal surfaces, and restrained
      research-lab clarity. The treatment should read as a wall boundary, not as
      new bulky geometry.
    Notes: Cool panel treatment with minimal geometry change.
  - SemanticLabel: floor
    FunctionTag: boundary
    Mode: 1
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 0
    ReplicaName: graphite anti-slip laboratory floor
    ReplicaFunction: walkable boundary
    AppearancePrompt: Dark graphite lab floor panels with fine cyan grid traces,
      low-glare anti-slip finish, clean modular seams, and clear readable walkable
      paths. Keep it calm and functional rather than decorative.
    Notes: Keep navigable footprint fully intact.
  - SemanticLabel: table
    FunctionTag: support_surface
    Mode: 2
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 1
    ReplicaName: modular future research worktable
    ReplicaFunction: support_surface for collaborative research work
    AppearancePrompt: A sleek rectangular research worktable with a thin durable
      composite tabletop, chamfered edges, subtle cyan emissive strips, compact technical
      support legs, and small embedded sensor-panel details. Preserve the real tabletop
      footprint, table height, long-axis orientation, and walk-around clearance.
    Notes: Preserve desk footprint for trust and clearance.
  - SemanticLabel: screen
    FunctionTag: display_surface
    Mode: 3
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 0
    ReplicaName: holographic research display board
    ReplicaFunction: display_surface
    AppearancePrompt: A transparent cyan holographic display treatment with thin
      luminous frame lines, quiet data-grid overlays, and readable research-board
      composition. It should stay wall/screen-aligned and avoid protruding into the
      room.
    Notes: Treat displays as holographic research boards.
  - SemanticLabel: storage
    FunctionTag: storage
    Mode: 2
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 1
    ReplicaName: modular lab archive storage
    ReplicaFunction: storage
    AppearancePrompt: Modular research archive cabinets with matte graphite panels,
      cyan status indicators, recessed handles, and clean labelled compartments.
      Preserve the original storage footprint and keep collision boundaries obvious.
    Notes: Stylize as modular archive storage.
  - SemanticLabel: seat
    FunctionTag: seating
    Mode: 2
    ProxyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    PrimaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    SecondaryMaterial: {fileID: 0}
    PreserveFootprint: 1
    PreserveYawOrientation: 1
    CollisionSensitive: 1
    ReplicaName: ergonomic lab collaboration seat
    ReplicaFunction: seating
    AppearancePrompt: Ergonomic future-lab seating with slim graphite supports, pale
      cushions, cyan trim, and a readable sit-able silhouette. Preserve the original
      seat footprint and facing direction.
    Notes: Keep seating role and placement readable.
